  {
    "formula": "integral_1^2 5 d x=5*1=5",
    "text": "A second disjoint interval of length one, with height five, contributes five. Whether an endpoint belongs to the first or second piece does not affect this Lebesgue integral, because the endpoint is a set of measure zero.",
